# infra/CODEOWNERS.template - copy to .github/CODEOWNERS and replace @OWNER with the human reviewer (or a team).
# Together with branch protection ("require review from Code Owners") this is the HUMAN approval for the paths the agent may not change on its own (infra/guard/protected-paths.txt).
/AGENTS.md                  @OWNER
/CLAUDE.md                  @OWNER
/.cursor/                   @OWNER
/.claude/                   @OWNER
/docs/                      @OWNER
# the four agent-maintained logs need no owner (a later line overrides the earlier one):
/docs/PROGRESS.md
/docs/DECISIONS.md
/docs/IDEAS.md
/docs/BLOCKED.md
/infra/                     @OWNER
/.github/                   @OWNER
/api/phpunit.xml            @OWNER
/api/.env.example           @OWNER
/api/tests/Fixtures/        @OWNER
/frontend/scripts/          @OWNER
/frontend/eslint.config.*   @OWNER
/frontend/.eslintrc*        @OWNER
**/Fixtures/                @OWNER
**/fixtures/                @OWNER
*golden*                    @OWNER
*Golden*                    @OWNER
